Auren
=====
Auren = Advanced Unified Retrieval Engine

In simple terms; search through a file system by text queries.

Stack
-----
GUI          - Tauri
Backend      - Go
Vector Store - FAISS
Embeddings   - (MiniLM) / (bge-m3 / nomic-embed-text) / (mxbai-embed-large)

Run (test)
---
Init python embed server: `py python/embed.py`
Init go backend server  : `go run ./cmd/server`

sample add cmd: 
```
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/add -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "documents": {
      "cloud_intro.md": "Cloud computing delivers computing services like servers, storage, databases, networking, and software over the Internet.",
      "devops_practices.md": "DevOps combines software development and IT operations. Key practices include CI/CD, infrastructure as code, and monitoring."
    }
  }'
```

sample search cmd: 
```
curl -X POST -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"query":"what is cloud computing","top_k":1}' http://localhost:8080/search
```